      "text": "Join a half-day Arequipa City Tour to explore the \"White City,\" known for its stunning colonial architecture and rich history. This guided tour will take you through the charming streets of Arequipa, offering a glimpse into its unique blend of Spanish and indigenous influences. The tour includes a visit to the Monasterio Santa Catalina (Santa Catalina Monastery), one of the most important and beautifully preserved religious sites in Peru. This vast complex, built in the 16th century, features narrow streets, colorful courtyards, and tranquil chapels, providing an intimate look into the monastic life of the past. \n\nOvernight in Arequipa."
    },
